
Challenge 098, Task #1: Read N-characters (Raku)

Input:
  File "digit.txt" contains "1234567890"
  File "alpha.txt" contains "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz"

Output:
  Read 4 characters from digit.txt: "1234"
  Read 5 characters from alpha.txt: "abcde"
  Read 3 characters from digit.txt: "567"
  Read 3 characters from alpha.txt: "fgh"
  Read 1 character  from digit.txt: "8"
  Read 4 characters from alpha.txt: "ijkl"
  Read 7 characters from digit.txt: "90"
  Read 4 characters from alpha.txt: "mnop"
  Read 2 characters from digit.txt: ""
  Reset and
  read 3 characters from digit.txt: "123"
